Subject: [PATCH net-next v5 5/9] net/smc: define a reserved CHID range for virtual ISM devices
Date: Fri,  8 Dec 2023 15:40:55 +0800
Message-Id: <1702021259-41504-6-git-send-email-guwen@linux.alibaba.com>
